<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.rmoura98.yonder</id>
  <name>Yonder</name>
  <summary>A tiny, open-source break reminder</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.rmoura98">
    <name>Yonder contributors</name>
  </developer>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT</project_license>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.rmoura98.yonder.desktop</launchable>
  <description>
    <p>Yonder reminds you to rest your eyes, fix your posture and take regular breaks, without breaking your flow. Free and open source, with no account and no telemetry.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Gentle 20-20-20 breaks that ask you to look into the distance</li>
      <li>Optional posture and blink reminders</li>
      <li>Smart pause during meetings and when you are away from the keyboard</li>
      <li>Office hours, statistics and global shortcuts</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <categories>
    <category>Utility</category>
  </categories>
